2: Rate limit kaha baita hoga? 

    Khudke samjh ke liye - 

a)  API Gateway Level
    Gateway pe global rate limit (jaise 10K req/min per user across all services )
    mat;ab user ki koi reuest aati hai humen define kar idya ki har user ki sirf 5 reqqest hi allow karo
    no matter wo kis service pai jane wali requst hai....sirf total 5 reqist per min hi aani chchaiye
    Fayda: 
    Centralized rate limting ...har servi epai rate limit ka logci nahai likha padega.


b) Har Service Level
   Har service ka apna rate limiter hoga i.e har servic eko cod elikha oadega rate kimti ka .
   service level paiu  hum dfiene akr sakt ehai ki us service pai user ki toal kitni reqat in a particular  window allowed hai.
   ya phir servie ye bhi kar sakti hai wo apne har endpoint ke liye ek different rate limit enforce kar sakti hai.


c) Hybrid — Dono (API Gateway Level + Har Service Level)
   Gateway pe global rate limit (jaise 10K req/min per user across all services)
   Service pe service-specific limit (jaise User Service: 100 req/min, Payment Service: 10 req/min)
    ya phir service apane aandar rate limit poer endpot bhi confoigure akr sakti hai.

  Generally hum Hybrid use karte hai. agr interveiwe bole you dedie to hum hbrid use kar sakt ehai.



2: Rate limit ke rules hardcoded (Static Configuration) rahenge ya  runtime (Dynamic Configuration) pe configurable hone chahiye?
  
   Khudke samjh ke liye - 
 
   Static Configuration:

   Static Configuration ka matlab hai ki Rate limit ke rules code/config file (jaise application.yml seriv eke aanda rya PAI gateway ke aanda r) me likhe hue hain.

   Nuksaan:
   - Har change ke liye servie / Gateway restart restart — downtime 
   
   - Emergency me (jaise attack aa gaya) aur humein turant limit tighten karni ho to ppossibel nahai 
      becasue pehel to hume chanege akr na padega (config file  mai) phur application/ API gateway ko restart karna
      padega jisme samay lagega.
   Fayda:
    - Simple (aagr PAi gateway par hai  Sab services ke rules ek jagah — centralized management ka fayda nahi mil raha)
    - Fast (koi DB call nahi)


   Dynamic Configuration:

   Rate limit ke rules DB me stored hote hain, aur application restart ke bina change ho sakte hain.



   



